  "adaptations": [
    "Operit pty.c is compiled unchanged with an explicit -D rename; pty_owner.c wraps forkpty to reclaim the child and master fd if JNI array allocation fails.",
    "PtyIo uses nonblocking Android Os.read/Os.write and JNI fcntl because Os.fcntlInt starts at API 30.",
    "Complete-sequence framing is only transport buffering; ANSI interpretation is exclusively Operit AnsiScanner and AnsiTerminalEmulator.",
    "Wide characters occupy two Operit cells; snapshots combine UTF-16 surrogate pairs and expose immutable continuation cells to the typed API.",
    "The shell is /system/bin/sh in the app sandbox. No PRoot, rootfs, installation or prebuilt Operit native library is included."
  ],
